======================================================================
XX. MULTIMODALITY
======================================================================
*/

ENUM Modality
    TEXT
    IMAGE
    AUDIO
    VIDEO
    MOVEMENT
    IMMERSIVE
    EMBODIED
    STRUCTURED_DATA
    CODE
END

FUNCTION REALIZE(state:Any, modality:Modality) -> Artifact
    ...
